{"id":"n14132-1-4","stage":3,"title":"실험 · 试验","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14132-1-4-1","ko":"카메라도 새로 샀으니 이제 여행만 떠나면 되겠다.","zh":"相机也刚买好了，现在只要出发去旅行就行了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"카메라도","meaning":"照相机","explanation":"카메라：照相机；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"카메라","audio":"/audio/6e2b53040cd15b607281.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57332","senseId":"1","lemma":"카메라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샀으니","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여행만","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떠나면","meaning":"去世，过世","explanation":"떠나다：去世，过世；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"떠나다","audio":"/audio/9ee56e8783da00e3fbed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53746","senseId":"6","lemma":"떠나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되겠다.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6e2b53040cd15b60","term":"카메라","