ation":"바깥：外，外面","readings":[{"term":"바깥","audio":"/audio/e8ec56791b98c029f85b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56330","senseId":"1","lemma":"바깥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"풍경","meaning":"风景，风光，景色，景致","explanation":"풍경：风景，风光，景色，景致","readings":[{"term":"풍경","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72392","senseId":"1","lemma":"풍경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찍어","meaning":"拍，拍摄","explanation":"찍다：拍，拍摄；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"찍다","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63320","senseId":"6","lemma":"찍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볼까?","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"59a4e3135e4e1d8f","term":"실험","zh":"试验，测试","audio":"/audio/59a4e3135e4e1d8fcde2.mp3","entryId":"14132","definition":"做某事前根据理论或想法实际试着做一下。","pronunciation":["실험"]},{"id":"e87e0eedb74b4776","term":"삼다","zh":"看作，当作","audio":"/audio/e87e0eedb74b47762143.mp3","entryId":"16205","definition":"把某对象作为自己行动或态度的根据。","pronunciation":["삼ː따"]},{"id":"e8ec56791b98c029","term":"바깥","zh":"外，外面","audio":"/audio/e8ec56791b98c029f85b.mp3","entryId":"56330","definition":"外边。","pronunciation":["바깓"]},{"id":"64d560d21687616f","term":"풍경","zh":"风景，风光，景色，景致","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3","entryId":"72392","definition":"大自然或某一地区的美景。","pronunciation":["풍경"]},